# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# This is a placeholder key.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
# IMPORTANT: Uncomment the line below if your app uses the Gemini API.
# If left commented out, the key will NOT be packaged in the APK.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY

# --- AdMob ad unit ids (v3.2.1) ---------------------------------------------
# While these stay commented out, the app uses Google's OFFICIAL TEST ad
# units: ads render as the static "Test Ad" creative and debug builds also
# show AdMob's "native ad validator" overlay — both are EXPECTED dev
# behavior and disappear with real ids / release builds.
#
# To serve REAL ads, create the units in your AdMob console and uncomment
# (ids below are placeholders — replace with your own):
# QUICKY_NATIVE_AD_UNIT=ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/NNNNNNNNNN
# QUICKY_CHAT_BANNER_AD_UNIT=ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/NNNNNNNNNN
# QUICKY_MATCHES_BANNER_AD_UNIT=ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/NNNNNNNNNN
# QUICKY_CLUB_BANNER_AD_UNIT=ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/NNNNNNNNNN
